# Installed packages. `package.json` + `package-lock.json` are the record; the tree
# itself is reproducible with `npm ci` and must never be committed.
#
# This file exists because resolving R-1 (policy/relaxations.md) introduced the first
# node_modules/ this repository has ever had. The gates already skip it — see
# tools/gates/scan.mjs SKIP_DIRS and tests/helpers.mjs — but a gate skipping a
# directory is not the same as version control ignoring it.
node_modules/

# Local verification evidence. `node tools/gates/trilateral.mjs --evidence` writes
# .cellular/evidence/trilateral.json so that a reader which cannot spawn a process —
# `observer.audit` — can report the typecheck/build/tests legs without pretending to have
# run them. It describes ONE machine at ONE moment, so committing it would turn a local
# measurement into a claim about everybody's checkout.
.cellular/

# OS and editor noise.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# The Prompt Builder's discovery draft (vault/builder/draft.json) is a private working
# file, not a record: the approved contract and the cells are what get committed.
vault/builder/
